    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praestōlātio</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		praestolor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the waiting for</i>, <i>expectation</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praestolatio impiorum furor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Prov. 11, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praestolatio tua non auferetur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 23, 18</span></i>
			; id. Job, 17, 15.</div>
